---
title: Upload path trust boundaries
---
flowchart LR
    accTitle: Upload path trust boundaries
    accDescr: Untrusted browser uploads cross into the application tier at the API gateway, and cross again into the storage tier when the scanner writes to the object store. Both crossings are the points where validation must happen.

    subgraph Untrusted["Untrusted — public internet"]
        User([Uploader])
    end

    subgraph App["Application tier"]
        GW[API gateway]
        Scan[Malware scanner]
    end

    subgraph Data["Storage tier"]
        Bucket[(Object store)]
        Meta[(Metadata DB)]
    end

    User -->|multipart upload| GW
    GW -->|size + MIME + auth check| Scan
    Scan -->|clean only| Bucket
    Scan -->|record| Meta
    Scan -->|quarantine| Quar[(Quarantine bucket)]

    classDef risk fill:#fbe4dc,stroke:#D55E00,stroke-width:2px,color:#5a2000
    class GW,Scan risk
